{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE REAL TIME STRATEGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the next evolution of tower defense with Elemental Rush. Unlike traditional games in the genre, this fully 3D adventure lets you to explore the battlefield freely, adding a new layer of strategy to every wave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/extras/e7041c41848322525ca3bf41c805ad82.poster.avif?t=1766076052\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/extras/e7041c41848322525ca3bf41c805ad82.webm?t=1766076052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/extras/e7041c41848322525ca3bf41c805ad82.mp4?t=1766076052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-- We have --</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>6 unique biomes</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>12 maps + a final level</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>3 difficulty levels for each map + endless mode</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>6 different elements of enemies and towers which are upgradable</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>3 unique enemy types</i> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-- So two battles are never the same --</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/extras/50777847cf78d0f87a31f8ed1131adf7.poster.avif?t=1766076052\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/extras/50777847cf78d0f87a31f8ed1131adf7.webm?t=1766076052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/extras/50777847cf78d0f87a31f8ed1131adf7.mp4?t=1766076052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have six biomes, each with two levels. In each biome, you will encounter different enemies that come in waves, and you must strategically place towers to defend yourself. Towers will be unlocked gradually.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-- Endless Mode --</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> is a brutal test of endurance and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies spawn endlessly \u2014 faster, stronger, and in larger numbers with each cycle. You can keep upgrading your towers infinitely, but every upgrade costs more than the last one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep up with the rising pressure, or will your defenses eventually crumble under the growing swarm?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Baby Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342900/7db6b3dfcafcfeeb7bf9fd15964f730608b4fef6.jpg"},{"name":"Still Alive!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342900/c42c837cc128e0d6a276ea07d27f72395a914205.jpg"},{"name":"Getting the Hang of It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342900/2700f46f05a1c9ff5e1fc932efff394d3278203d.jpg"},{"name":"This Is Fine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342900/e56cfa22f0164251d33b6175d6b5267a4a63a44f.jpg"},{"name":"Defense Addict","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342900/039ae3fa68c41d7e20dfbf9ff72ec044bb72903f.jpg"},{"name":"Halfway Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342900/553782ddd6f786ce2e19f6907bdfa85e1db68fe0.jpg"},{"name":"Tower Master in Training","path