radually.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-- Endless Mode --</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> is a brutal test of endurance and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies spawn endlessly \u2014 faster, stronger, and in larger numbers with each cycle. You can keep upgrading your towers infinitely, but every upgrade costs more than the last one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep up with the rising pressure, or will your defenses eventually crumble under the growing swarm?</p>","developers":["SparkyByteGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/10960fff8fe17a548c679cb4ba650e2edf78ae15/header.jpg?t=1766076052","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3500X / Intel Core i5-9400F or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 (6GB VRAM minimum) / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT (6GB VRAM minimum) or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1920x1080, 60FPS, low quality, Internet connection required for achievements</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3342900/378860392/2e37b4e31f87379f24a3b09a4bff7b8af03024ec/1750841760/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749806583","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3342900/378860392/2e37b4e31f87379f24a3b09a4bff7b8af03024ec